	"data": "Multimodal Environmental Sensing — Research & Architecture\n\nCreated: 2026-07-03\nContext: Room 2.0 / ThoughtBubbles — spatial UI using depth, acoustic, and RF sensing\nRelated: [[research/semantic-room-understanding]] · [[projects/room-2-0]] · [[concepts/thought-bubbles]]\n\nThe Core Insight\n\nNo single sensing modality sees the whole room. Depth cameras miss glass and mirrors. Acoustic sensing can't produce dense geometry. Wi-Fi CSI can't resolve fine detail. But together, they cover each other's…",
